      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "If I ain't got nothing, I got you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "If I ain't got something, I don't give a damn",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause I got it with you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I don't know much about algebra",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But I know one plus one equals two",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And it's me and you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That's all we'll have when the world is through",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "'Cause baby, we ain't got nothing without love",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Darling, you got enough for the both of us",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So come on, baby",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
