        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I hope that I'm gon' die by you, hey",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And I don't know much about fightin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But I, I know I will fight for you, hey",
